  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "We interchange the signs in the given options & solve them using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nOption 1) 20 × 12 + 6 - 16 ÷ 8 = 20\n\n20 - 12 + 6 × __**16 ÷ 8**__ = 20\n\n20 - 12 + __**6 × **__**__2__** = 20\n\n__**20**__ - 12 __**+ **____1____2__ = 20\n\n__**32 - 12**__ = 20\n\n20 = 20\n\nOption 2) 16 × 91 ÷ 13 + 5 - 3 = 24\n\n16 - __**91 ÷ 13**__ + 5 × 3 = 24\n\n16 - 7 + __**5 **____**×**____** 3**__ = 24\n\n__**16**__ - 7 __**+ 1**5__ = 24\n\n__**31 - 7**__ = 24\n\n24 = 24 \n\nOption 3) 20 × 8 - 4 ÷ 2 + 3 = 7\n\n20 - 8 × __**4 ÷ 2**__ + 3 = 7\n\n20 - __**8 **____**× **2__ + 3 = 7\n\n__**20**__ - 16 __**+ 3**__ = 7\n\n__**23 - 16**__ = 7\n\n7 = 7\n\nOption 4) 4 × 5 - 36 ÷ 6 + 10 = 10\n\n4 - 5 × __**36 ÷ 6**__ + 10 = 10\n\n4 - __**5 **____**× **6__ + 10 = 10\n\n__**4**__ - 30 __**+ 10**__ = 10\n\n__**14 - 30**__ = 10\n\n**-16 ≠ 10**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\".**",
